 autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/bca5e2408bd098fd86c3126413175230.poster.avif?t=1780601981\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/bca5e2408bd098fd86c3126413175230.webm?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/bca5e2408bd098fd86c3126413175230.mp4?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/894704422d493b7d2dd6cf5b748730bc.poster.avif?t=1780601981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/894704422d493b7d2dd6cf5b748730bc.webm?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/894704422d493b7d2dd6cf5b748730bc.mp4?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wade through an onslaught of Null Corp.’s <strong>biomechanical workers</strong>, <strong>warriors</strong>, and <strong>constructed horrors</strong> tasked with stopping your crusade. Armed with your <strong>cutlass</strong> and <strong>deadly roller-boots</strong>, hack these foes to pieces and craft <strong>powerful weapons</strong> from their remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/a9c8e34dd73daf4c008c590d8c28842c.poster.avif?t=1780601981\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/a9c8e34dd73daf4c008c590d8c28842c.webm?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/a9c8e34dd73daf4c008c590d8c28842c.mp4?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/4f7116baf0c71478c0b1687732af2e1d.poster.avif?t=1780601981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/4f7116baf0c71478c0b1687732af2e1d.webm?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/4f7116baf0c71478c0b1687732af2e1d.mp4?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>strange characters</strong>, trawl <strong>forgotten passages</strong>, and break into <strong>secret facilities</strong>. Traverse the layers of the city to face Null Corp. head on. Get lost in the decaying world of <strong>Reclaimer</strong> and find  beauty amongst the rubble.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/099f8975e449bc06e25a3ef54ef193e4.poster.avif?t=1780601981\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/099f8975e449bc06e25a3ef54ef193e4.webm?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303180/extras/099f8975e449bc06e25a3ef54ef193e4.mp4?t=1780601981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c